      en: ["The average depth of Pape Lake is only 0.5 meters.", "Wild horses of the Konik breed were introduced in 1999.", "The first aurochs back-breeding arrived in the reserve in 2004.", "Over 250 bird species have been sighted in the nature park area.", "The fishing village of Pape preserves architecture from the 19th century.", "The Pape ornithological station rings up to 50,000 birds annually."],
